  "prefLabel": "Rev 2404.03 Apportionment for Grantor Trust Activity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2404.03 Apportionment for Grantor Trust Activity. A grantor of a grantor trust shall include the apportionment factor information of the grantor trust within its own compensation, interest, and dividend factors.\n\nSource. INTERIM #5708, eff 9-23-93, EXPIRED: 1-21-94; ss by #5774, eff 1-21-94; ss by #7178, eff 12-23-99, EXPIRED: 12-23-07\n\nNew. #9065, eff 1-10-08 (from Rev 2404.02); ss by #11032, eff 1-29-16; ss by #14573, eff 5-2-26, EXPIRES: 5-2-36",
